---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY MAPPING (web → native)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  data:   CurvePoint { soc, power(kW) } (types.ts)            → SessionCurvePoint (Adapter); SI-invariant (kW, %) — no unit convert
  build:  curveData prop from generateChargingCurve(session)  → SessionCurveChartSource snapshot → SessionCurveProjection.points
  round:  data table `Math.round(p.power*10)/10`, power ≥ 0   → SessionCurveProjection.roundPower + max(0,·); sorted by SOC
  shell:  <FadeIn> + <ChartContainer title/subtitle/aria>     → TSFadeIn + tokenized glass card (Color.TS.surface + TSRadius.lg + Color.TS.border)
  title:  t('charging.curve.powerVsSoc','Power vs SOC')       → SessionCurveStrings key, panel title (SessionCurveHeader)
  sub:    t('…powerVsSocDesc','Charging power curve …')       → header subtitle (caption, textMuted)
  chart:  Recharts AreaChart <Area dataKey=power monotone     → Swift Charts Chart{ AreaMark + LineMark }.interpolationMethod(.monotone),
          strokeWidth 2, fill url(areaGradient .3→.02),          lineWidth 2, TSChartGradient.fill(colorIndex:0), TSChartPalette.color(at:0)
          stroke CHART_COLORS[0], unit " kW">                     (web CHART_COLORS[0] == brand chartCategorical[0], same #0072B2)
  xaxis:  <XAxis dataKey=soc label "SOC (%)">                  → .chartXScale(SOC domain) + .chartXAxisLabel("SOC (%)") + tokenized AxisMarks
  yaxis:  <YAxis label "Power (kW)">                           → .chartYScale(0…peak·1.1) + .chartYAxisLabel("Power (kW)") + tokenized AxisMarks
  tip:    <Tooltip content={<ChartTooltip/>}>                 → SessionCurveTooltip via .chartXSelection RuleMark+PointMark annotation
  empty:  ChartContainer empty / no rows                      → .empty phase; ContentUnavailableView (common.noData) — never a blank box
  i18n:   charging.curve.* + power/SOC labels                 → resolved through SessionCurveStrings facade (table "SessionCurveChart")

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface):
  loading  → SessionCurveLoadingChart (TSSkeleton; reduce-motion safe)
  content  → SessionCurveAreaChart (gradient area + monotone line + selection tooltip)
  empty    → SessionCurveEmpty (ContentUnavailableView, web common.noData)
  error    → SessionCurveError (QueryError-equiv, Retry → model.refresh())
  stale    → freshness chip (Stale) + connectivity banner + one guarded auto-refresh
  offline  → freshness chip (Offline) + banner; keeps cached curve, no refetch
a11y: chart-level VoiceOver summary (title + point count + peak kW + SOC span),
  per-sample tooltip value, reduce-motion animation gate, Dynamic Type via system
  fonts/tokens, Retry button labeled.
telemetry: P1/S11 view.opened(surface:"SessionCurveChart") emitted once on appear.
units: power is kW and SOC is %, both unit-system-invariant; the leaf receives
  display-ready values (parent applies any SI→display at the boundary), so no
  per-user unit conversion happens at this surface — consistent with the web leaf.

